DESCRIPTION:Charming Cockney geezer Lenny Sherman THINKS he’s one of the 
 good guys. But the reality is the big\, scary\, inappropriate thug is blind
  to his flaws and thinks his crazy behaviour is normal... And that’s wher
 e the comedy lies. The lovable rogue has a good heart and is doing his best
  to grow\, but cor blimey! He ain’t half got a long way to go! Big Sherm 
 tackles identity politics\, football culture\, and family life – sharing 
 personal anecdotes and observations with a provocative style. Expect unexpe
 cted twists and a punchline to remember.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.ap
 p/comedy-atlas/event/lenny-sherman-one-of-the-good-guys-25471/
